@host = http://localhost:5160
@id = COPIAR_ID
@token = COPIAR_ORDER_TOKEN

### Crear orden de prueba (PNG mínimo)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/
Content-Type: application/json

{"amountMxn":10,"style":"cartoon","photoBase64":"iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mP8/x8AAusB9Wl6JZQAAAAASUVORK5CYII="}

### Copiar id y token de la respuesta a variables arriba
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{id}}/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SOLO DEMO: nunca existe esta ruta en modo Pey
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{id}}/simulate-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generar (una sola vez, debe estar pagado)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{id}}/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Estado
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Descargar
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{id}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
